<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #facc15;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #4f46e5;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            background: #f3f4f6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to <span><%= title %></span></h1>
        <p>Your Express and EJS application is running successfully 🚀</p>

        <a href="#" class="btn">Get Started</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>